  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/04/ViaCrucisDilluns140414Tales-007.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La tarde de este lunes, 14 de abril, se ha celebrado por el centro hist&oacute;rico deTales un Via Crucis, acompa&ntilde;ado por l&#39;Associaci&oacute; de Tambors i Bombos local. Las estaciones se han ido sucediendo en distintos rincones y plazas.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/viacrucisdillunstales/viacrucisdilluns140414tales-001.jpg\" alt=\"viacrucisdilluns140414tales-001\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/viacrucisdillunstales/viacrucisdilluns140414tales-002.jpg\" alt=\"viacrucisdilluns140414tales-002\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/viacrucisdillunstales/viacrucisdilluns140414tales-003.jpg\" alt=\"viacrucisdilluns140414tales-003\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/viacrucisdillunstales/viacrucisdilluns140414tales-004.jpg\" alt=\"viacrucisdilluns140414tales-004\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/viacrucisdillunstales/viacrucisdilluns140414tales-005.jpg\" alt=\"viacrucisdilluns140414tales-005\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/viacrucisdillunstales/viacrucisdilluns140414tales-006.jpg\" alt=\"viacrucisdilluns140414tales-006\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/viacrucisdillunstales/viacrucisdilluns140414tales-007.jpg\" alt=\"viacrucisdilluns140414tales-007\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439e